<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-18T16:02:14.126Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:02:14 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes continue in Narathiwat, with police officers and insurgents killed in multiple gun battles, including a policeman killed on National Police Day. A pipe bomb in Yala wounded five army officers and a separate bomb injured five security volunteers. An air hostess is linked to a ring smuggling Chinese nationals across the Thai-Malaysian border, and a cross-border fiber-optic cable was found connecting a house to a Myanmar casino operation. Chinese embassy and travel agencies have issued fresh alerts over kidnappings and job scams targeting Chinese travelers in Thailand. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFA3dXhDVEtQX2x5Qk1hWXpZSS10Q29RNGl4RUUyblBkMVN5d29GcTk0cFFYeE9qUFVTOTBmLTI5S3dkU3UyZGZ6NjFiYnZPOWN6cnQ4b3RyUTYwendj?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE8tRk45dmdRMVNtRmd4V1RsRzVPNWVsbXlOYjRzcGpCNWstcE4wR19uQ3NENEF3VjNTSV9rMDBLOXItX0xtbnFMZ3lYNndSZWhhS1RVUWRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ynetnews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE9qbzFxUW1LMDZhNUIyTExTcjhLVTJsaDF2TmoxRmFhd2dYdFduWUMtQm9hUzFjOU4zMTN4ZTNtMHJsZzk0enZ0QkdtaVRRWnlqYzRF?oc=5&quot;&gt;JFeed&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPMDFrSVg4MDFuZW5kV0lqeXJ6cWVLU2VVQmdEWUtiMGJPSE9kMkoxelpDU3Jhb1JkTlRoWUZGOVFDQzJtZ3VSTFF0ZG95d1cwei1Qa1did0hfc2FvOXpJVUVIUUpnamM0bVJzUWZUZEFNNEdVazJvVnRSdlp4c1dPY2ZEbWM2V3VRWmdBdG9OVXZGRWpiOXA4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNdW0wUTFrdDE1ZTBuZG0tWklkOGhTclMyOFk5dnk0TmdqOUJ